{
  "_comment": [
    "qits-1849: the payload fields of the events a declared wait is checked against (EventPayloadCatalog).",
    "A field is \"scalar\", an object {field: …}, a list of scalars [\"scalar\"] or a list of objects [{field: …}].",
    "eventId and occurredAt ride the envelope and are never payload fields; a null field is dropped from a",
    "payload, so every field here is optional on the wire. Keys starting with '_' are comments.",
    "The qits-workspaces entries are pinned by EventPayloadCatalogDriftTest against workspaces-events' records.",
    "Every other entry is TRANSCRIBED BY HAND from its publisher's records and pinned by no test, unlike",
    "qits-maintenance's ForeignEventContractTest: a field renamed there makes this door refuse a wait on the",
    "new name until it is transcribed here. On 2026-11-04 (qits-1849): qits-ci's ci-events (BuildStatusChanged,",
    "BuildSuccessful, BuildFailed, SoftwareRelease) and qits-projects' service bus package (ReleaseRequestStateChanged,",
    "EntityTransitioned, EntityCommented, BranchDeliveryChanged, SCMRelease). On 2026-11-09 (qits-1964): the rest of",
    "qits-projects' bus package (ReleaseRequestChanged, ReleaseRequestSourceMoved, ApprovalRequirementChanged,",
    "RepositoryRenamed, WorkNeedMet, ProjectCreated, ProjectChanged, ProjectDeleted, IdeaCreated, IdeaUpdated,",
    "IdeaArchived, IdeaUnarchived); qits-githost's githost-events (SCMPublishCommit, SCMPublishTag, SCMDeleteBranch,",
    "SCMDeleteTag); qits-deployments' deployments-events (DeploymentQueued, DeploymentStarted, DeploymentActive,",
    "DeploymentFailed, EnvironmentCreated, EnvironmentChanged, EnvironmentDeleted); qits-system's targets events",
    "package (TargetConnectionChanged, TargetLoginChanged, TargetOomKilled, TargetLeaseChanged).",
    "An event with several publishers lists the union of their fields: TargetLeaseChanged (qits-system, and the",
    "copies in qits-ci, qits-projects and qits-workspaces' targethost packages), ReleaseRequestStateChanged,",
    "ApprovalRequirementChanged and RepositoryRenamed (qits-ci's and qits-projects' bus packages).",
    "An event named nowhere here is refused (qits-1964): a new event needs its entry before a wait can name it."
  ],
